#: .\exercise\serializers.py:164
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Optional. If provided on POST, the newly created Exercise is atomically "
#| "attached to this Round. The request user must manage at least one team of "
#| "at least one Event linked to this Round (library rounds with no events "
#| "are accepted as-is). Ignored on PATCH/PUT."
msgid ""
"Optional. On POST, the newly created Exercise is atomically attached to this "
"Round. On PATCH/PUT, if the Exercise is shared by several Rounds "
"(usage_count > 1), it is forked: a clone with the changes is swapped into "
"THIS Round and the shared original is left untouched. The request user must "
"manage at least one team of an Event linked to this Round (library rounds "
"with no events are accepted as-is)."
msgstr ""
"Facoltativo. Se fornito in un POST, l'esercizio appena creato viene allegato "
"in modo atomico a questo round. L'utente della richiesta deve gestire almeno "
"un team di almeno un evento collegato a questo round (i round di libreria "
"senza eventi sono accettati così come sono). Ignorato in PATCH/PUT."

